    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Midnight Survivors</strong> is a game where you survive waves of enemies by sweeping them away with firepower until the very end. It combines the elements of traditional bullet hell roguelike shooters with defense mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/422de31f68ea6566af9d5a8faf5526ab.poster.avif?t=1746087802\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/422de31f68ea6566af9d5a8faf5526ab.webm?t=1746087802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/422de31f68ea6566af9d5a8faf5526ab.mp4?t=1746087802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/9a550ae9c1e4f1749dd31710359b60a7.poster.avif?t=1746087802\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/9a550ae9c1e4f1749dd31710359b60a7.webm?t=1746087802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/9a550ae9c1e4f1749dd31710359b60a7.mp4?t=1746087802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Meet 6 different cats.</strong><br>Defend the village and survive using cats, each equipped with unique weapons and overdrive shots.h equipped with unique weapons and overdrive shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/c8eac55484f22dad627bc1fd23ac31e5.poster.avif?t=1746087802\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/c8eac55484f22dad627bc1fd23ac31e5.webm?t=1746087802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/c8eac55484f22dad627bc1fd23ac31e5.mp4?t=1746087802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Between waves, use the money you've earned to buy and place turrets or plant mines.</strong><br>As the waves increase, enemies become stronger and more numerous, but your cats will also grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/a68d33752f49eaeacc26a6530a0b4e1c.poster.avif?t=1746087802\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/a68d33752f49eaeacc26a6530a0b4e1c.webm?t=1746087802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/a68d33752f49eaeacc26a6530a0b4e1c.mp4?t=1746087802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hatch eggs and gain allies.</strong><br>Hatch eggs found in chests to recruit allies and defeat enemies together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/ee1eb90d1f3ba7f3552c2c9d05c02526.poster.avif?t=1746087802\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/ee1eb90d1f3ba7f3552c2c9d05c02526.webm?t=1746087802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/ee1eb90d1f3ba7f3552c2c9d05c02526.mp4?t=1746087802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If you need more firepower, visit the shop and buy items.</strong><br>Face the hordes of enemies with items like lock-on lasers, meteors, and homing missiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/c295094e368d14ee2c4fe5f2e6d40741.poster.avif?t=1746087802\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/c295094e368d14ee2c4fe5f2e6d40741.webm?t=1746087802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/c295094e368d14ee2c4fe5f2e6d40741.mp4?t=1746087802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Look forward to future updates with new stages and weapons!</p>",
